        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$x^2-\\frac{8x}{3}=1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac13$ or $x=3$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3x^2-8x&=3\\\\3x^2-8x-3&=0\\\\(3x+1)(x-3)&=0\\\\3x+1&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-3=0\\\\x&=-\\frac13\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 46
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$x+\\frac{8x}{3}-\\frac{13}{6}=0$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\frac{13}{22}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}6x+16x-13&=0\\\\22x-13&=0\\\\22x&=13\\\\x&=\\frac{13}{22}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 30
      },
      {
        "id": "p24-q6-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\frac{7}{3x-4}-\\frac{2}{x+2}=1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac{10}{3}$ or $x=3$.",
          "worked": "$x\\ne\\frac43,-2$. Multiply both sides by $(3x-4)(x+2)$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}7(x+2)-2(3x-4)&=(3x-4)(x+2)\\\\x+22&=3x^2+2x-8\\\\3x^2+x-30&=0\\\\(3x+10)(x-3)&=0\\\\3x+10&=0\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x-3=0\\\\x&=-\\frac{10}{3}\\quad\\text{or}\\quad x=3\\end{align*}$$\n\nBoth values satisfy the original equation: for $x=-\\frac{10}{3}$, the left-hand side is $-\\frac12+\\frac32=1$; for $x=3$, it is $\\frac75-\\frac25=1$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 88
      }
    ]
